      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Considering the iOS version is unavailable on macOS, the only real way to play on macs without also owning an iOS device is through a Virtual Machine. The tech landscape is increasingly moving towards architectural independence, virtualization will continue to be used to bridge the software gap created by differing chip architectures. This issue is not going away and even as someone who doesn't use VMs, I can safely say that's not gonna last long the way the computer industry is moving these days. From someone who cares about the longevity of this game I love I believe this issue should be looked at seriously.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
